          <span class="section-label">Founder &amp; CEO</span>
          <h2>Dr. John Liao</h2>
          <h3>廖肇弘 博士</h3>

          <div class="founder-titles">
            <p>Founder &amp; CEO, AI TalenTech Labs</p>
