            <p class="advisor-bio">
              <strong>A pioneer at the intersection of AI and creative innovation.</strong> Currently Associate Professor and Chair of the Department of New Media and Communication Design at I-Shou University. Holds a Ph.D. in Engineering from National Taiwan University and was a visiting researcher at Hamburg University of Technology in Germany — a foundation that combines deep cross-domain technical expertise with international perspective. His research integrates AI technologies with design thinking, spanning generative AI design, XR game development, deep learning, and academia–industry entrepreneurship. He champions an &ldquo;X+AI&rdquo; pedagogical model on university campuses and partnered with NVIDIA to launch Taiwan's first NVIDIA Studio × GIGABYTE collaboration space — a creative platform for generative AI design, 3D animation, and immersive coursework. He is a leading figure in advancing Taiwan's AI-powered creative arts and new-media talent development.
            </p>
            <p class="advisor-bio">
              On the industry side, Prof. Sun continues to push the frontier of AI digital transformation. He recently published a book exploring NVIDIA's AI ecosystem — <em>Generative AI: The Future of Digital Transformation</em> — examining the innovation roadmap of Kaohsiung's Asia New Bay Area 2.0 and Taiwan's sovereign AI strategy. He has been an invited speaker at NVIDIA GTC.
            </p>

